  "title": "Multimodal Fake News Detection in Generative AI: A Framework for Robustness and Detection",
  "summary": "This report introduces a multi-agent framework for detecting multimodal fake news using a collaboration between a story agent, image agent, and critic agent, with experiments on over 9,000 paired multimodal posts across domains. The GAHR framework combines generativity with veracity reasoning to improve detection accuracy, while the ELERF and RAEGNet models address limitations in existing detection methods.",
